window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When the Shadows set you free…will you let them claim you?</p> <p></p> <p>My worst nightmare has come true. Sergi Petrov, the man my father sold me to, has me in his grip again. This time, even my Shadows aren’t strong enough to fight his obsession.</p> <p></p> <p>I endure every night in his mansion—twenty-one days of his attention, his delusion—submitting so my men, my soulmates, can live free. I will suffer anything to ensure their safety.</p> <p></p> <p>Every night, my will to survive is tested, with only Nikolai, Sergi’s own son, helping me resist the darkness his father creates inside me.</p> <p></p> <p>My Shadows refuse to give up, using all of their underworld resources to help bring me home.</p> <p></p> <p>But will it be enough to finally break the hold Sergi has on me?</p> <p></p> <p>Or am I already bound to him in a way neither of us saw coming, a part of his darkness growing inside me, inescapable and inevitable?</p> <p></p> <p>And can my men accept me now that I have been so tainted?</p>"; 
